e computation. *(NS9, NS3; P7 required-before-build)*\n87\t\n88\t### PHASE B â€” UNDERSTAND + firewall *(autonomous)* â€” closes internal **Milestone M1 (comprehension-only preview)**\n89\t- **B1 â€” Comprehension protocol.** Step-0 firewall-applicability classifier (3-way enum) + the stateless 5-step spine; emits typed claims into A1. *(NS1)*\n90\t- **B2 â€” Firewall builder** (+ the A2(3) coverage-stamp canary). prose â†’ ref-fn + spec + tests; NECESSARY-9 trust gate; the three reading-independent anchors; the ANCHOR-AVAILABILITY gate; the `firewall_status`/`anchor_coverage`/`warranty_excludes[]`/`reduced-warranty` stamps; **S4 invariant** (ref-fn generator-independent, else cap CLAIMED). *(NS1, NS3; S4 required-before-build)*\n91\t- **B3 â€” Commission EMITTERS + boundary canary.** Typed Gandalf + researchPrime envelope emitters (emit, never dispatch); the no-inline-reimplementation boundary canary. *(NS8)*\n92\t- **B-shim â€” M1 read-only dispatch shim.** A minimal read-only single-pillar dispatch demonstrating \"one tool\" at first ship; grown to multi-pillar in D4; covered by the A2(7) no-dispatch canary. *(NS objective)*\n93\t\n94\t> **Milestone M1 â€” \"comprehension-only preview\"** *(renamed; resolves m1-slice-unusable):* spine +\n95\t> provenance + UNDERSTAND+firewall + the read-only shim. NOT a full partner â€” SOLVE/DIALOGUE/FORMALIZE/\n96\t> CONTEXTUALIZE are absent; UNDERSTAND yields OBSERVED only when the firewall is computable, else\n97\t> CLAIMED/ABSTAIN. The SKILL.md headline says so up-front.\n98\t\n99\t### PHASE C â€” SOLVE + CONTROL *(autonomous)*\n100\t- **C1 â€” Generation + decompose.** Stateless Polya/Schoenfeld GENERATION â†’ typed-claim DECOMPOSE into A1 (cheap + UNVERIFIED). *(NS2)*\n101\t- **C2 â€” Claim-type DISPATCH classifier.** Fail-safe, separate-pass, conservative escalation to the proof route. *(NS3)*\n102\t- **C3 â€” Metacognitive CONTROL state machine.** continue/switch/**ABANDON** on a budget; **S1 thresholds + gap-function (r