 that states up-front what the autonomous tier CAN settle (literal finite computation, re-execution-backed) and CANNOT (any same-family object / non-literal claim â‡’ ABSTAIN+route). **Done-when:** SKILL.md exists, names all six pillars + the Honesty Law, manifest passes. *(NS objective)*\n- **A0.5a â€” Inheritance presence/interface gate** *(required-before-build).* Locate + version + interface-SHAPE check each inherited artifact; fail fast; no A1/A3 dependency. *(NS objective, NS8)*\n- **A1 â€” Typed CLAIM ledger.** Rung ladder `REFUTED < UNVERIFIED < CLAIMED < CORROBORATED < OBSERVED`; belief-tag = deterministic projection; sticky semantics; **`promote()` is the SOLE rung-raiser.** *(NS5)*\n- **A1.5 â€” The out-of-model adjudication-artifact substrate** *(resolves the round-2 BLOCKER, re-scoped per round-3; P9 required-before-build).* A rung promotes to VERIFIED ONLY when it binds to a SUBPROCESS-PRODUCED artifact the canary **independently RE-EXECUTES or RE-HASHES out-of-band** â€” the A4 sandbox trace autonomously; Lean `.olean` / SMT UNSAT cert in Phase F. **Only the dispatcher writes family-of-record, bound to the actual certifier invocation.** `promote()`-to-VERIFIED hard-faults to ABSTAIN absent a valid fresh artifact. **Done-when (NEGATIVE â€” resolves a1.5-promote-gate-bootstrap-circularity):** with NO minter present, promote()-to-VERIFIED hard-faults to ABSTAIN (the positive path is first exercisable at A4). **Build-dep: A1.5 â†’ A4.** **Honest limit:** single-process forgery-resistance is best-effort (AS3); the warrant is re-execution, not a key. *(NS9, NS5, NS4)*\n- **A0.5b â€” Inheritance conformance gate.** After A1/A3: exercise each inherited seam against the real ledger/router contract with a passing fixture; gates Phase B+. *(NS objective, NS8)*\n- **A2 â€” The Honesty-Law canary suite (gated `node --test`)** *(mandatory; NS9), all verifying the re-executable artifact (not a plaintext field). Split by producer-availability (resolves phase-a-canary-load-front-loaded):*\n  - **A2-core (lands in Phase A â€” producers exist):** (1) **independence** the artifact attests `verifier_family â‰  authoring_family`; (2) **inverted-completeness** `VERIFIED â‡’ an artifact-backed independent why_event_log event`; (4) **transitions-invariant** the sticky-flip law; (5) **flip-law** every VERIFIED transition binds to a re-executed out-of-model adjudicator artifact (propose â‰  adjudicate).\n  - **A2-deferred (co-located with its producer):** (3) **coverage-stamp** (`predicate_domain âŠ‡ claim_domain`, caps at CLAIMED on warranty_excludes[]â‰ âˆ… / anchor_coverage<full) â†’ with **B2**; (6) **degradation-tripwire** (delete-fixture â‡’ still refuses green) â†’ with **D1**; (7) **no-dispatch** (orchestrator emits only ASK/route, never a commission-id) â†’ with **D4**. Each remains a mandatory gated wave; it just lands where its producer lands. *(NS8, NS9)*\n- **A3 â€” The VERIFY router skeleton.** Typed-claim DECOMPOSE â†’ DISPATCH â†’ route to the strongest APPLICABLE generator-independent verifier â†’ honest ABSTAIN/FLAG + advisory payload (1C); per-claim rung + artifact-backed verifier-family STAMP + advisory NOTES. *(NS3, NS5, NS9)*\n- **A4 â€” The autonomous-VERIFIED gate.** The literal-execution recognizer as a **CLOSED default-deny whitelist GRAMMAR** â€” settle ONLY inputs parsing as the literal-finite-computation grammar; anything unparsed/outside â‡’ ABSTAIN+route. The firewall sandbox is the OUT-OF-MODEL SUBPROCESS that produces the re-executable A1.5 artifact. **Done-when:** proves the default-deny path + a fuzz/property test (SAFETY) **AND a positive-recall fixture roster (P7) of in-class computations the grammar MUST parse-and-settle (COVERAGE)**; the laundering battery is regression-only. **Drift-watch:** no grammar widening beyond literal finite computation. *(NS9, NS3; P7 required-before-build)*\n\n### PHASE B â€” UNDERSTAND + firewall *(autonomous)* â€” closes internal **Milestone M1 (comprehension-only preview)**\n- **B1 â€” Comprehension protocol.** Step-0 firewall-applicability classifier (3-way enum) + the stateless 5-step spine; emits typed claims into A1. *(NS1)*\n- **B2 â€” Firewall builder** (+ the A2(3) coverage-stamp canary). prose â†’ ref-fn + spec + tests; NECESSARY-9 trust gate; the three reading-independent anchors; the ANCHOR-AVAILABILITY gate; the `firewall_status`/`anchor_coverage`/`warranty_excludes[]`/`reduced-warranty` stamps; **S4 invariant** (ref-fn generator-independent, else cap CLAIMED). *(NS1, NS3; S4 required-before-build)*\n- **B3 â€” Commission EMITTERS + boundary canary.** Typed Gandalf + researchPrime envelope emitters (emit, never dispatch); the no-inline-reimplementation boundary canary. *(NS8)*\n- **B-shim â€” M1 read-only dispatch shim.** A minimal read-only single-pillar dispatch demonstrating \"one tool\" at first ship; grown to multi-pillar in D4; covered by the A2(7) no-dispatch canary. *(NS objective)*\n\n> **Milestone M1 â€” \"comprehension-only preview\"** *(renamed; resolves m1-slice-unusable):* spine +\n> provenance + UNDERSTAND+firewall + the read-only shim. NOT a full partner â€” SOLVE/DIALOGUE/FORMALIZE/\n> CONTEXTUALIZE are absent; UNDERSTAND yields OBSERVED only when the firewall is computable, else\n> CLAIMED/ABSTAIN. The SKILL.md headline says so up-front.\n\n### PHASE C â€” SOLVE + CONTROL *(autonomous)*\n- **C1 â€” Generation + decompose.** Stateless Polya/Schoenfeld GENERATION â†’ typed-claim DECOMPOSE into A1 (cheap + UNVERIFIED). *(NS2)*\n- **C2 â€” Claim-type DISPATCH classifier.** Fail-safe, separate-pass, conservative escalation to the proof route. *(NS3)*\n- **C3 â€” Metacognitive CONTROL state machine.** continue/switch/**ABANDON** on a budget; **S1 thresholds + gap-function (required-before-build); done-when incl. an explicit ABANDON fixture** (non-converging input â‡’ ABANDON within budget, claim left UNVERIFIED/CONJECTURAL). *(NS2)*\n- **C4 â€” In-process adversarial layer (ADVISORY).** Gandalf/researchPrime