+ the sleep-loop feeding the oracle's fixture-failure learning. *Inherited-substrate; lowest priority; deferrable past M1.*\n- **E3 â€” Author SKILL.md (full)** *(mandatory).* Full tiered-scope headline; \"no autonomous proof verification; ACCEPT = computational sub-claim\". **Done-when incl. an INVOCATION SMOKE TEST** + the 5-gate productionization checklist + manifest checker. *(NS objective)*\n\n### PHASE F â€” decision-c INTEGRATION *(HALT-gated)*\nPromotability: F0 + F2-against-fixture-proofs post-A; F1/F3/F5 declare B/C/D emitters as build-deps.\n- **F0 â€” Environment LIVENESS + per-CLASS INTEGRITY probe** *(resolves f0-integrity-challenge-nondeterministic-certifier).* Liveness (handle reachable Â· `lake build` green on a trivial proof Â· SMT responds) AND a known-answer integrity challenge **by certifier CLASS:** *deterministic (Lean/SMT)* = a single sentinel known-FALSE it MUST reject + a known-true it must accept (re-exec/re-hash); *probabilistic (cross-family LLM)* = an **N-trial sentinel battery at temp=0 against a pinned pass-threshold**, the artifact CARRIES the empirical reject-rate, and an under-threshold certifier is **capped at CORROBORATED-degraded (never OBSERVED)** + quarantined â†’ degradation contract. **Pin N + threshold as Stage-2 required-before-build (P8).** *(NS3/NS4)*\n- **F1 â€” Cross-family MODEL verifier** â†’ informal proofs to **CORROBORATED** (artifact-bound). *(NS3, NS5)*\n- **F2 â€” Lean toolchain** â†’ formalizable proofs to **OBSERVED** (`.olean` re-checked); gated by NS4 faithfulness. *(NS3)*\n- **F3 â€” SMT-roundtrip faithfulness certifier** (P8 + the F0 integrity challenge). *(NS4)*\n- **F4 â€” Autonomous commission DISPATCH** + silent intent-classification. *(NS8)*\n- **F5 â€” The human gate** (Formalize assent + faithfulness final) + cross-family GROUNDED-rung promotion. *(NS7, NS5)*\n\n---\n\n## PART 3 â€” REQUIRED-BEFORE-BUILD (Stage-2 entry gates)\n- **A0.5a** â€” inheritance presence/interface gate green.\n- **R1** â€”