M1 renamed \"comprehension-only preview\"** + the SKILL.md up-front headline. RESOLVED.\n- degradation-voice-obstructive â†’ **1C advisory-payload invariant** + E1 fixture. RESOLVED. Â· a1.5-bootstrap-circularity â†’ **A1.5 NEGATIVE done-when + A1.5â†’A4 build-dep**. RESOLVED.\n- phase-a-canary-load-front-loaded â†’ **A2 split into A2-core / A2-deferred**. RESOLVED. Â· a4-grammar-completeness â†’ **P7 positive-recall roster** gating E1's computational delta. RESOLVED.\n\n## PART 9 â€” ROUND-4 & ROUND-5 CONVERGENCE RECORD\n- **Round 4 (competitor / bored-investor / future-maintainer):** all three fresh Sharks returned ZERO findings â†’ an EMPTY round; per the engine's I7 honest-convergence guard an empty round is NOT counted (a run must not converge by declining to look). dryStreak held at 1.\n- **Round 5 (steel-man / security / frustrated-UX):** a non-empty confirmation round â€” only NIT/MINOR findings (explicit confirmations + the four PART-3 Stage-2 carry-overs), ZERO blockers/majors, no â‰¥2-agree. Judge=CONVERGED. dryStreak â†’ 2/2 â†’ **CONVERGED** with unresolvedHigh=0 and the honesty guard clean.\n- **Verdict:** the Master Plan is engine-converged and Judge-confirmed sound. It now HALTS for the **USER's Stage-1 approval** before Crucible Stage 2 (Implementation Plan â†’ well-formedness gate â†’ Foreman handoff). The user is the final convergence authority.\n","numLines":172,"startLine":1,"totalLines":172}}}
