{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NPmL6j58dXZzZyJzsVUWw3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Ramanujan â€” Crucible Stage 1: MASTER PLAN (draft v4, post-round-3)\n2\t\n3\t> Traces to the LOCKED North Star v3 (6 pillars on one shared spine; THE HONESTY LAW). Every wave\n4\t> carries its NS criterion. Out-of-scope growth â†’ Grasscatcher; refinement â†’ HALT-for-user NS\n5\t> amendment (never silent re-scope). Planning-loop honesty stamp: `cross_model:false` (single-family\n6\t> Sharks/Judge; CBS register FLAGGED-not-mitigated). **v4 makes the out-of-model boundary HONEST for\n7\t> the single-process substrate (re-executable/re-hashable SUBPROCESS ARTIFACT, not a same-process\n8\t> signature), specifies a per-certifier-CLASS integrity challenge, and relabels Milestone M1 truthfully.**\n9\t> Dispositions: round-1 PART 6, round-2 PART 7, round-3 PART 8.\n10\t\n11\t---\n12\t\n13\t## PART 1 â€” ORANGES BRAINSTORM (real-intent foresight)\n14\t\n15\t### 1A. Assumption map\n16\t- **AS1 (load-bearing):** the six pillars compose on ONE shared spine â€” typed CLAIM ledger + VERIFY router + within-session STATE â€” built ONCE, not six silos. *(NS objective)*\n17\t- **AS2 (load-bearing):** the autonomous single-family tier settles a rung to VERIFIED ONLY for a literal finite computation **whose rung binds to a valid out-of-model adjudication ARTIFACT â€” a subprocess-produced trace the canary RE-EXECUTES or RE-HASHES out-of-band** (the A4 sandbox); everything else ABSTAINS to CONJECTURAL and routes out-of-model. *(Honesty Law, NS9)*\n18\t- **AS3 (de-claimed):** the canaries + oracle are **best-effort single-family enforcement; residual correlated-blind-spot risk is ACCEPTED and FLAGGED** (cross_model:false). **Single-process autonomous forgery-resistance is best-effort** â€” the genuine boundary is the subprocess artifact's re-execution, not an in-process key.\n19\t- **AS4:** R1, S4, S1, P3, P7 (incl. its positive-recall roster), P8 (incl. the per-class integrity-challenge N + threshold), P9 (the provenance-binding contract) are pinnable by the Crucible/Stage-2; Stage 2 shows each pinned value + owner + a terminus-acceptance check.\n20\t- **AS5:** cross-family / Lean / SMT are integration cost, confirmed present **and correct** by the F0 liveness + per-class integrity probe before any rung is trusted.\n21\t- **AS6:** persona substrate (Fable 5 / Opus) present; a 2nd family is reachable only when the user promotes Phase F.\n22\t- **AS7 (GATED):** the inherits compose without rebuild â€” verified by **A0.5a/A0.5b**, not asserted.\n23\t\n24\t### 1B. Premortem (each â†’ a mitigation wave)\n25\t- **PM1** Gandalf-cycle (no SKILL.md) â†’ **A0 + E3** (E3 incl. invocation smoke test).\n26\t- **PM2** Honesty-Law erosion â†’ the A2 canary suite **resting on the re-executable subprocess artifact**; independence + flip-law first.\n27\t- **PM3** Firewall shared-origin laundering â†’ S4 invariant (cap CLAIMED) + the three reading-independent anchors (B2).\n28\t- **PM4** Scope drift \"just add Lean\" â†’ Phase F HALT-gated; per-wave autonomous-vs-c-dependency stamp.\n29\t- **PM5** Unpinned decisions â†’ R1/S4/S1/P3/P7/P8/P9 + A0.5a required-before-build.\n30\t- **PM6** Silos â†’ spine-first; the M1 read-only shim â†’ D4 orchestrator + a no-dispatch canary.\n31\t- **PM7** Fake oracle convergence â†’ ablation + canned baseline + Metric G, scoped to the computational slice; proof/conceptual arms assert ABSTAIN-correctness.\n32\t- **PM8** Dispatch over-reach â†’ emit-not-dispatch; D4 fail-safe ASK/read-only + a no-dispatch canary; autonomous SILENT dispatch = F4 (HALT-gated).\n33\t- **PM9** Hollow Phase-F pillars â†’ the DEGRADATION CONTRACT (1C) as a runtime promote-gate **that also emits an advisory payload** (not bare refusal).\n34\t- **PM10** Laundered non-literal â†’ A4 closed default-deny grammar **+ a positive-recall roster** (no over-block).\n35\t- **PM11** Correlated single-family blind spot â†’ E1 red-team set; AS3 de-claimed.\n36\t- **PM12 (re-scoped) Forged provenance:** a same-family object self-asserts a rung. â†’ the **re-executable/re-hashable subprocess artifact** (P9): the canary independently reproduces the certifier artifact rather than trusting a signature/label.\n37\t- **PM13** Reachable-but-WRONG certifier â†’ **F0 per-class known-answer integrity challenge** (deterministic: single sentinel; probabilistic cross-family: N-trial battery + pinned threshold; quarantine on miss).\n38\t- **PM14** Circular build ordering â†’ split A0.5 (a: stubs; b: conformance after A1/A3); **A1.5 has a NEGATIVE done-when + an A1.5â†’A4 build-dep** (its positive token path is first exercisable at A4).\n39\t\n40\t### 1C. THE DEGRADATION CONTRACT (STRUCTURAL + ADVISORY â€” NS6/NS7/NS9)\n41\tThe spine enforces this as a RUNTIME INVARIANT on every `promote()` call â€” **a rung reaches VERIFIED\n42\tiff it binds to a valid, fresh out-of-model adjudication ARTIFACT the canary re-executes/re-hashes;\n43\tabsent/stale â‡’ hard-fault to ABSTAIN.** And **every ABSTAIN/CONJECTURAL/degraded verdict MUST carry an\n44\tadvisory payload** (the candidate reasoning + the cross-family NOTES + a one-step \"promote Phase F to\n45\tsettle this\" affordance) so honest degradation is still useful, not obstructive. Per-pillar:\n46\t- **DIALOGUE (D1):** proof/conceptual claims asserted ONLY as **CONJECTURAL** + the advisory payload; never assert-as-settled by omission. *(NS6)*\n47\t- **FORMALIZE (D2):** autonomous = **emitter/abstain stub** (`formalize_status:requires-Phase-F`, **no green**); P3 example-space-stability is **ADVISORY-only, never a faithfulness proxy**. *(NS7, NS4)*\n48\t- **VERIFY router (A3):** no applicable autonomous verifier â‡’ ABSTAIN/FLAG + route + payload; never a silent pass.\n49\t- **Enforcement:** the A2 degradation-tripwire canary deletes the abstain fixture and proves the system still refuses green; an E1 fixture asserts every abstain response is non-empty/actionable. Softening ABSTAIN-and-route = SCOPE CHANGE â†’ HALT-for-user NS amendment.\n50\t\n51\t### 1D. Ideate â†’ batch triage\n52\tKEEP: spine-first phasing Â· the canary suite on the re-executable-artifact substrate Â· two SKILL.md\n53\twaves Â· one verify ROUTER Â· Phase F as one HALT block Â· per-boundary composition canaries Â· the\n54\trequired-before-build gate set Â· the autonomous read-only orchestrator (M1 shim â†’ D4) Â· the M1 slice Â·\n55\tthe subprocess-artifact provenance binding Â· the non-deletable+advisory promote-gate Â· A4 default-deny\n56\tgrammar **+ recall roster** Â· the F0 per-class integrity challenge Â· the A0.5 split.\n57\tDROP â†’ Grasscatcher: cross-session memory store. DROP: autonomous proof solver; fold-Lean-into-autonomous.\n58\tREJECT: weaken/fold the canaries (anti-drift). De-claim (not drop): cryptographic \"unforgeable token\"\n59\tâ†’ honest re-execution (the substrate can't hold a key from itself).\n60\t\n61\t---\n62\t\n63\t## PART 2 â€” THE PHASED MASTER PLAN\n64\t\n65\t**Substrate honesty:** Phases Aâ€“E are AUTONOMOUS on the bare single-family subscription. **Phase F is\n66\tthe decision-c integration (cross-family + Lean + SMT) and is HALT-gated.** Promotability: **F0 +\n67\tF2-against-fixture-proofs are exercisable right after Phase A; F1/F3/F5 require their B/C/D emitters.**\n68\t\n69\t### PHASE A â€” Spine, provenance & honesty skeleton *(autonomous)*\n70\t- **A0 â€” Author SKILL.md skeleton** *(mandatory).* Stub + tiered-scope headline that states up-front what the autonomous tier CAN settle (literal finite computation, re-execution-backed) and CANNOT (any same-family object / non-literal claim â‡’ ABSTAIN+route). **Done-when:** SKILL.md exists, names all six pillars + the Honesty Law, manifest passes. *(NS objective)*\n71\t- **A0.5a â€” Inheritance presence/interface gate** *(required-before-build).* Locate + version + interface-SHAPE check each inherited artifact; fail fast; no A1/A3 dependency. *(NS objective, NS8)*\n72\t- **A1 â€” Typed CLAIM ledger.** Rung ladder `REFUTED < UNVERIFIED < CLAIMED < CORROBORATED < OBSERVED`; belief-tag = deterministic projection; sticky semantics; **`promote()` is the SOLE rung-raiser.** *(NS5)*\n73\t- **A1.5 â€” The out-of-model adjudication-artifact substrate** *(resolves the round-2 BLOCKER, re-scoped per round-3; P9 required-before-build).* A rung promotes to VERIFIED ONLY when it binds to a SUBPROCESS-PRODUCED artifact the canary **independently RE-EXECUTES or RE-HASHES out-of-band** â€” the A4 sandbox trace autonomously; Lean `.olean` / SMT UNSAT cert in Phase F. **Only the dispatcher writes family-of-record, bound to the actual certifier invocation.** `promote()`-to-VERIFIED hard-faults to ABSTAIN absent a valid fresh artifact. **Done-when (NEGATIVE â€” resolves a1.5-promote-gate-bootstrap-circularity):** with NO minter present, promote()-to-VERIFIED hard-faults to ABSTAIN (the positive path is first exercisable at A4). **Build-dep: A1.5 â†’ A4.** **Honest limit:** single-process forgery-resistance is best-effort (AS3); the warrant is re-execution, not a key. *(NS9, NS5, NS4)*\n74\t- **A0.5b â€” Inheritance conformance gate.** After A1/A3: exercise each inherited seam against the real ledger/router contract with a passing fixture; gates Phase B+. *(NS objective, NS8)*\n75\t- **A2 â€” The Honesty-Law canary suite (gated `node --test`)** *(mandatory; NS9), all verifying the re-executable artifact (not a plaintext field). Split by producer-availability (resolves phase-a-canary-load-front-loaded):*\n76\t  - **A2-core (lands in Phase A â€” producers exist):** (1) **independence** the artifact attests `verifier_family â‰  authoring_family`; (2) **inverted-completeness** `VERIFIED â‡’ an artifact-backed independent why_event_log event`; (4) **transitions-invariant** the sticky-flip law; (5) **flip-law** every VERIFIED transition binds to a re-executed out-of-model adjudicator artifact (propose â‰  adjudicate).\n77\t  - **A2-deferred (co-located with its producer):** (3) **coverage-stamp** (`predicate_domain âŠ‡ claim_domain`, caps at CLAIMED on warranty_excludes[]â‰ âˆ… / anchor_coverage<full) â†’ with **B2**; (6) **degradation-tripwire** (delete-fixture â‡’ still refuses green) â†’ with **D1**; (7) **no-dispatch** (orchestrator emits only ASK/route, never a commission-id) â†’ with **D4**. Each remains a mandatory gated wave; it just lands where its producer lands. *(NS8, NS9)*\n78\t- **A3 â€” The VERIFY router skeleton.** Typed-claim DECOMPOSE â†’ DISPATCH â†’ route to the strongest APPLICABLE generator-independent verifier â†’ honest ABSTAIN/FLAG + advisory payload (1C); per-claim rung + artifact-backed verifier-family STAMP + advisory NOTES. *(NS3, NS5, NS9)*\n79\t- **A4 â€” The autonomous-VERIFIED gate.** The literal-execution recognizer as a **CLOSED default-deny whitelist GRAMMAR** â€” settle ONLY inputs parsing as the literal-finite-computation grammar; anything unparsed/outside â‡’ ABSTAIN+route. The firewall sandbox is the OUT-OF-MODEL SUBPROCESS that produces the re-executable A1.5 artifact. **Done-when:** proves the default-deny path + a fuzz/property test (SAFETY) **AND a positive-recall fixture roster (P7) of in-class computations the grammar MUST parse-and-settle (COVERAGE)**; the laundering battery is regression-only. **Drift-watch:** no grammar widening beyond literal finite computation. *(NS9, NS3; P7 required-before-build)*\n80\t\n81\t### PHASE B â€” UNDERSTAND + firewall *(autonomous)* â€” closes internal **Milestone M1 (comprehension-only preview)**\n82\t- **B1 â€” Comprehension protocol.** Step-0 firewall-applicability classifier (3-way enum) + the stateless 5-step spine; emits typed claims into A1. *(NS1)*\n83\t- **B2 â€” Firewall builder** (+ the A2(3) coverage-stamp canary). prose â†’ ref-fn + spec + tests; NECESSARY-9 trust gate; the three reading-independent anchors; the ANCHOR-AVAILABILITY gate; the `firewall_status`/`anchor_coverage`/`warranty_excludes[]`/`reduced-warranty` stamps; **S4 invariant** (ref-fn generator-independent, else cap CLAIMED). *(NS1, NS3; S4 required-before-build)*\n84\t- **B3 â€” Commission EMITTERS + boundary canary.** Typed Gandalf + researchPrime envelope emitters (emit, never dispatch); the no-inline-reimplementation boundary canary. *(NS8)*\n85\t- **B-shim â€” M1 read-only dispatch shim.** A minimal read-only single-pillar dispatch demonstrating \"one tool\" at first ship; grown to multi-pillar in D4; covered by the A2(7) no-dispatch canary. *(NS objective)*\n86\t\n87\t> **Milestone M1 â€” \"comprehension-only preview\"** *(renamed; resolves m1-slice-unusable):* spine +\n88\t> provenance + UNDERSTAND+firewall + the read-only shim. NOT a full partner â€” SOLVE/DIALOGUE/FORMALIZE/\n89\t> CONTEXTUALIZE are absent; UNDERSTAND yields OBSERVED only when the firewall is computable, else\n90\t> CLAIMED/ABSTAIN. The SKILL.md headline says so up-front.\n91\t\n92\t### PHASE C â€” SOLVE + CONTROL *(autonomous)*\n93\t- **C1 â€” Generation + decompose.** Stateless Polya/Schoenfeld GENERATION â†’ typed-claim DECOMPOSE into A1 (cheap + UNVERIFIED). *(NS2)*\n94\t- **C2 â€” Claim-type DISPATCH classifier.** Fail-safe, separate-pass, conservative escalation to the proof route. *(NS3)*\n95\t- **C3 â€” Metacognitive CONTROL state machine.** continue/switch/**ABANDON** on a budget; **S1 thresholds + gap-function (required-before-build); done-when incl. an explicit ABANDON fixture** (non-converging input â‡’ ABANDON within budget, claim left UNVERIFIED/CONJECTURAL). *(NS2)*\n96\t- **C4 â€” In-process adversarial layer (ADVISORY).** Gandalf/researchPrime critique â€” NOTES only, barred from the rung. *(NS9)*\n97\t\n98\t### PHASE D â€” PARTNER LAYER + Orchestrator *(autonomous)*\n99\t- **D1 â€” DIALOGUE state machine** (+ the A2(6) degradation-tripwire canary). Lakatos loop; mixed-initiative; the structured emission contract; **Grice Quality + the 1C degradation contract (incl. the advisory payload)**; the anti-sycophancy STICKY ledger; done-when incl