· SMT responds) AND a known-answer integrity challenge **by certifier CLASS:** *deterministic (Lean/SMT)* = a single sentinel known-FALSE it MUST reject + a known-true it must accept (re-exec/re-hash); *probabilistic (cross-family LLM)* = an **N-trial sentinel battery at temp=0 against a pinned pass-threshold**, the artifact CARRIES the empirical reject-rate, and an under-threshold certifier is **capped at CORROBORATED-degraded (never OBSERVED)** + quarantined â†’ degradation contract. **Pin N + threshold as Stage-2 required-before-build (P8).** *(NS3/NS4)*\n- **F1 â€” Cross-family MODEL verifier** â†’ informal proofs to **CORROBORATED** (artifact-bound). *(NS3, NS5)*\n- **F2 â€” Lean toolchain** â†’ formalizable proofs to **OBSERVED** (`.olean` re-checked); gated by NS4 faithfulness. *(NS3)*\n- **F3 â€” SMT-roundtrip faithfulness certifier** (P8 + the F0 integrity challenge). *(NS4)*\n- **F4 â€” Autonomous commission DISPATCH** + silent intent-classification. *(NS8)*\n- **F5 â€” The human gate** (Formalize assent + faithfulness final) + cross-family GROUNDED-rung promotion. *(NS7, NS5)*\n\n---\n\n## PART 3 â€” REQUIRED-BEFORE-BUILD (Stage-2 entry gates)\n- **A0.5a** â€” inheritance presence/interface gate green.\n- **R1** â€” oracle fixture roster + k/k' + FP tolerance. Â· **S1** â€” CONTROL thresholds + gap-function.\n- **S4** â€” ref-fn-independence invariant + roster + per-claim-type margins + golden routing stubs.\n- **P3** â€” example-space-stability predicate (ADVISORY-only). Â· **P7** â€” the A4 default-deny grammar + its laundering-rejection battery **+ the positive-recall roster**.\n- **P8** â€” the SMT-roundtrip faithfulness contract **+ the F0 per-class integrity-challenge format incl. N + pass-threshold for the probabilistic class.**\n- **P9** â€” the provenance-binding contract: artifact format + the canary's out-of-band re-execution/re-hash procedure + freshness (A1.5).\n- **Stage-2 obligation:** for EACH residual, show the pinned value + owner + a te